Zg5RhEeuGwgQ7kNvwHR7uQI&_nc_oc=Adp5EIMmytUgvmCaL4EJsIHoOhx6OhCFhnMR4imkf4-Bbx9WYHAvym_xMUFAl9iTlYo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLwUxh_yp0o_M6oC_9ztq8Lwv_GGs0SDawJeroD_sRXqQ&oe=6AAD4737"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=332UdgBIQ14Q7kNvwHv4qCo&_nc_oc=Adq-mnC0uO9QK1gZmHViEG0SbqkrZ8pfafpq9kVwtfTY6h6Usrp4-Ct4nSERfeGnyxw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLnJyaML6RaG3WxGg-yfnttoQaWzcIPJJl3gGKX_v8nTw&oe=6AAD48CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D1Wm-WPD8V4Q7kNvwGXiYGi&_nc_oc=Adpq0o0wPvzkoesUB7aJyWgo5LVwM0BSh61jTcaIYCHgbx6r5ASB-UEUj6TSx6xEZWU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLMrYn9qvcuiO7BKHLRHMPKX5sqUrUIqoGGBhkXMpwa3A&oe=6AAD35EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oDDM5QiSaHkQ7kNvwHOHeX6&_nc_oc=AdpLPiKUmH5PBec_eengoEZt-MQv6tMu9-8OTOcNAB76F075ZDmdC5p9njz3axqmfZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJznYenMtUGnvi6nksRCnF6pYSqP7NoWBj1X-AQVrgd8w&oe=6AAD5783"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6JvbChsIlQkQ7kNvwHstwyc&_nc_oc=AdrK8iAIaan57W1dF8dNCSnYeh_scriFukdQPrV2-LVI76STZcNT6Vk8dn2HxHDXvsI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJpAkFVfOSvSHtLL_EDoO26eV5KbJa4hMGHOS5pgEt6zQ&oe=6AAD4FD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NKUsFH325vMQ7kNvwHPgkqR&_nc_oc=Adpmu3kvmEK6q48U0Qdm6JJRL8IOEB8BRKIJXdVx4em9w6Nwnf5FTywYK-Zw5idUMAM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLXbJCsSgw1hwPY81RQiExkBNjS0cRksl8PGp61R74xdQ&oe=6AAD62FC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080